<main id="main">
<h1>A bakery built around the neighborhood.</h1>
<p>North Star begins with a simple idea: a bakery should be a familiar
  stop, whether you have five minutes before work or a whole morning
  to catch up.</p>
<section aria-labelledby="story-title">
  <h2 id="story-title">Small batches. Familiar faces.</h2>
  <p>Our story centers on everyday reasons to gather around food:
    a loaf shared at dinner, a birthday cake carried carefully home,
    or a cookie saved for someone else.</p>
  <p>We imagine a bakery where the counter team learns your favorites
    and helps you find something new. That welcome belongs to a
    first-time visitor and a weekly regular.</p>
  <img src="assets/bakery-storefront_c.png" width="288" height="172"
    alt="Bakery window full of breads and pastries beside a dark door.">
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="sourcing-title">
  <h2 id="sourcing-title">Care starts with the ingredients.</h2>
  <h3>Choose for flavor</h3>
  <p>Our proposed approach starts with dependable flour, butter, and
    seasonal ingredients selected for the foods we want to bake.</p>
  <h3>Build local relationships</h3>
  <p>We aim to work with nearby suppliers when their ingredients
    fit our menu and availability. No specific supplier partnership
    is claimed for this fictional client.</p>
  <h3>Make room for questions</h3>
  <p>Customers should be able to ask about ingredients and preparation.
    Allergy needs would be discussed before a pickup is confirmed.</p>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="team-title">
  <h2 id="team-title">A small team with shared care.</h2>
  <h3>The bread baker</h3>
  <p>Keeps an eye on dough, timing, and each loaf as it moves from
    the workbench to the oven.</p>
  <h3>The pastry baker</h3>
  <p>Plans sweet counter favorites and helps turn celebration ideas
    into practical cake options.</p>
  <h3>The counter team</h3>
  <p>Welcomes visitors, explains the day's selection, and gathers
    the details needed for pickup inquiries.</p>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="question-title">
  <h2 id="question-title">Have something in mind?</h2>
  <p>Tell us what you are planning. A simple question is a good start.</p>
  <p><a href="contact.html#request">Contact North Star Bakery</a>.</p>
</section>
</main>
<footer>
  <p>North Star Bakery: Bread for the table. Something sweet for the road.</p>
  <p><a href="products.html">Explore our products</a> |
    <a href="contact.html">Hours and location</a></p>
  <p>Fictional bakery for a course project. Business details and prices
    are sample content; this website does not accept real orders.</p>
</footer>
