      <li><a href="about.html">About</a></li>
      <li><a href="contact.html" aria-current="page">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>
</header>
<main id="main">
<h1>Let's make room for something good.</h1>
<p>Tell us what you would like and when you hope to pick it up.
  General questions are welcome, too.</p>
<section aria-labelledby="form-title">
  <h2 id="form-title">Your bakery inquiry</h2>
  <p id="demo-note">Classroom demonstration: use sample information.
    This HTML-only form checks required fields and email format.
    Submitting reloads this page with entries in the address bar;
    it does not contact a bakery or place an order.</p>
  <form id="request" action="contact.html#request" method="get"
    aria-labelledby="form-title" aria-describedby="demo-note">
    <fieldset>
      <legend>Your contact details</legend>
      <p>
        <label for="name">Name (required)</label><br>
        <input id="name" name="name" type="text" required
          autocomplete="name" maxlength="100">
      </p>
      <p>
        <label for="email">Email (required)</label><br>
        <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required
          autocomplete="email" maxlength="200">
      </p>
    </fieldset>
    <fieldset>
      <legend>Your request</legend>
      <p>
        <label for="request-type">Request type (required)</label><br>
        <select id="request-type" name="request_type" required>
          <option value="">Choose a request type</option>
          <option value="preorder">Preorder inquiry</option>
          <option value="general">General question</option>
        </select>
      </p>
      <p>
        <label for="pickup-date">Preferred pickup date</label><br>
        <input id="pickup-date" name="pickup_date" type="date"
          aria-describedby="pickup-help">
      </p>
      <p id="pickup-help">For a preorder inquiry, please choose a
        preferred date. Leave blank for a general question.
        Closed Mondays; dates would need confirmation.</p>
      <p>
        <label for="item-details">Item details or question
          (required)</label><br>
        <textarea id="item-details" name="item_details" required
          rows="4" cols="28" maxlength="2000"
          aria-describedby="item-help"></textarea>
      </p>
      <p id="item-help">For preorders, include items and quantities.
        For cakes, add the number of guests and decoration ideas.</p>
      <p>
        <label for="allergy-notes">Allergy notes (optional)</label><br>
        <textarea id="allergy-notes" name="allergy_notes"
          rows="3" cols="28" maxlength="1000"
          aria-describedby="allergy-help"></textarea>
      </p>
      <p id="allergy-help">Describe concerns so ingredients and
        preparation can be discussed. A note does not confirm
        an accommodation.</p>
    </fieldset>
    <p><button type="submit">Submit sample inquiry</button></p>
  </form>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="location-title">
  <h2 id="location-title">Come by the counter.</h2>
  <address>North Star Bakery<br>
    125 North Star Lane<br>
    Maple Grove, MN 55311</address>
  <p>Sample location for this fictional client.</p>
  <h3>Hours of operation</h3>
  <dl>
    <dt>Tuesday-Friday</dt><dd>7 am-4 pm</dd>
    <dt>Saturday-Sunday</dt><dd>8 am-2 pm</dd>
    <dt>Monday</dt><dd>Closed</dd>
  </dl>
  <p>Pickup inquiries would be subject to availability.
    Walk-in selections may vary throughout the day.</p>
  <p><a href="products.html">Browse products before your inquiry</a>.</p>
</section>
</main>
<footer>
  <p>North Star Bakery: Bread for the table. Something sweet for the road.</p>
  <p><a href="products.html">Explore our products</a> |
    <a href="contact.html">Hours and location</a></p>
  <p>Fictional bakery for a course project. Business details and prices
    are sample content; this website does not accept real orders.</p>
</footer>
</body>
</html>

